{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/pulls/841","id":5002353486,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR0xlYM8AAAABKinbTg","html_url":"https://github.com/pirl-unc/hitlist/pull/841","diff_url":"https://github.com/pirl-unc/hitlist/pull/841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pirl-unc/hitlist/pull/841.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/issues/841","number":841,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add audited native same-parent response recipe","user":{"login":"iskandr","id":48441,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48441?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr","html_url":"https://github.com/iskandr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskandr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem and behavior\n\nPXD018722 native intracellular measurements can now be queried, but the source\npackage does not define a defensible training target. Add the registered\n`pxd018722_native_contrast_v1` recipe: one control-to-PSMD2-knockdown change in\nwithin-parent log10 peptide/reference signal per nonreference peptide.\n\nThe fixed cohort requires literal human nonengineered origins at one complete\nparent sequence, agreeing resolved declared parents, valid search/confidence\nsupport, and six positive original sequence-level signals. Hashes choose the\nreference and split the complete source dependency components before selection.\nAll excluded decisions, six source ratios, twelve measurement contributions,\nmodification/matching annotations and component/parent weights remain auditable.\nZeros do not become negatives, numbered acquisitions do not become paired\nspecimens, and raw signals do not become molar concentrations.\n\nThe public materialize/verify interface pins source/recipe contracts, preserves\nindependent snapshots and replays every typed output. A failed support gate is\nreported without changing eligibility or partitions. Version: 2.0.38.\n\n## Validation and interpretation\n\n- `./format.sh`, `./lint.sh`, 36 focused tests and all 3,547 current-main default tests pass (the original base passed 3,544).\n- Tests cover original quantity grain, precursor/load/fixed-peptide-response\n  cancellation, no pseudoreplication, ambiguous/unresolved/reporter origins,\n  zero/missing signals, all-source dependencies, unequal group weights, hash-only\n  reference/splits, no overwrite and refreshed-hash target-tamper detection.\n- Independent real-source replay verifies all 10,647 dispositions, 228 targets\n  and 2,736 measurement contributions. The frozen cohort has 82 parents across\n  81 components: training 55 components/158 contrasts, validation 8/38, test 18/32.\n- Public materialization/replay: 29.36 seconds, 2,483.3 MiB observed process-tree\n  RSS. Independent original-value replay: 4.04 seconds, 1,866.1 MiB. All resource\n  limits pass. An initial local test memory-preflight refusal is preserved; the\n  unchanged guard admitted the later passing run after capacity recovered.\n\nThis qualifies a conditional native-signal response dataset for a prospective\nscreen. No predictor is fitted here. The validation partition is at its minimum\ncomponent support; APC transfer, concentration calibration and the latent full\npeptide distribution remain unresolved.\n\nFollow-up to #837 and merged source PR #839. Keep #837 open for the broader data\nand biological-validation work. The recipe must pass hosted checks and its tested\nPyPI release before use in the separately registered biological fit.\n\n\n[Registered Presto source-admission report and exact reproduction bundle](https://github.com/pirl-unc/presto/blob/84b1e593bf8ffd8effc642ea32b93422e13b9a99/experiments/2026-10-25_0612_codex_native-contrast-admission/README.md). The current-main amendment preserves the original successful run and verifies the same package under rebased commit 90a7a62 in 5.06 s / 1,702.9 MiB, with no cohort or target changes. Source release 40168710669 tests current main d2e0cb6 after concurrent PR840; original successful e755be4 artifacts are verified and retained, not uploaded over the newer same-version main.\n","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:17:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T06:27:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"97b362e888f6de07ef1fcd295e0fa66c0e619090","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/pulls/841/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/pulls/841/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/issues/841/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pirl-unc/hitlist/statuses/90a7a62a5f1e052d87e797d86bac6d59cf3b0700","head":{"label":"pirl-unc:codex/native-contrast-recipe-20261025","ref":"codex/native-contrast-recipe-20261025","sha":"90a7a62a5f1e052d87e797d86bac6d59cf3b0700","user":{"login":"pirl-unc","id":71463575,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjcxNDYzNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71463575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirl-unc","html_url":"https://github.com/pirl-unc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pirl-unc/followers","following_url":"htt